WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.118
The Bloggins Files — one hundred and eighty classified military memes from Bloggins Enterprises.

00:00:06.068 --> 00:00:12.443
Battle plans, unhinged maps, rubber duck intelligence operations, and the Avro Arrow recovery mission.

00:00:12.443 --> 00:00:20.545
This is the lighter side of the investigation — because sometimes the absurdity of the institution is best captured in satire rather than statistics.
